{
  "uid": "monitoraqua-aumentados-kafka",
  "title": "F2b - Datos aumentados en Kafka (flota extrapolada)",
  "description": "Métricas a nivel Kafka (kafka-exporter -> Prometheus). Los paneles de contenido (nivel, anomalías por tipo, episodios) llegan en F3/F5, alimentados por Spark.",
  "tags": ["monitoraqua", "f2b", "datos-aumentados"],
  "timezone": "America/Lima",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {"from": "now-1h", "to": "now"},
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "topico",
        "label": "Tópico (real / aumentado)",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "aqua-eventos-aumentados,aqua-eventos-real",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": {"selected": true, "text": ["aqua-eventos-aumentados"], "value": ["aqua-eventos-aumentados"]},
        "options": [
          {"selected": true, "text": "aqua-eventos-aumentados", "value": "aqua-eventos-aumentados"},
          {"selected": false, "text": "aqua-eventos-real", "value": "aqua-eventos-real"}
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "",
      "gridPos": {"h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "**Datos aumentados**: flota extrapolada (`origen = flota-extrapolada`, `fuenteTipo = aumentado`), tópico `aqua-eventos-aumentados`. Se usan para volumen y para evaluar modelos; la demo en vivo y la métrica final de cada modelo usan solo **datos reales** (`aqua-eventos-real`). Ver `docs/datos-aumentados.md`."}
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "stat", "title": "Eventos retenidos por tópico",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 3},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "legendFormat": "{{topic}}",
                   "expr": "sum by (topic) (kafka_topic_partition_current_offset{topic=~\"$topico\"}) - sum by (topic) (kafka_topic_partition_oldest_offset{topic=~\"$topico\"})"}],
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value_and_name"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Eventos por segundo (publicación)",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 3},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "legendFormat": "{{topic}}",
                   "expr": "sum by (topic) (rate(kafka_topic_partition_current_offset{topic=~\"$topico\"}[1m]))"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 15}}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "bargauge", "title": "Distribución por partición (clave sensorId)",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "legendFormat": "{{topic}} · p{{partition}}",
                   "expr": "kafka_topic_partition_current_offset{topic=~\"$topico\"} - kafka_topic_partition_oldest_offset{topic=~\"$topico\"}"}],
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "orientation": "horizontal", "displayMode": "gradient", "showUnfilled": true},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Eventos por segundo por partición",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "legendFormat": "{{topic}} · p{{partition}}",
                   "expr": "rate(kafka_topic_partition_current_offset{topic=~\"$topico\"}[1m])"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0}}, "overrides": []}
    },
    {
      "id": 6, "type": "stat", "title": "Particiones y réplicas en sincronía",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "legendFormat": "{{topic}} particiones", "expr": "kafka_topic_partitions{topic=~\"$topico\"}"},
        {"refId": "B", "legendFormat": "{{topic}} réplicas sub-replicadas", "expr": "sum by (topic) (kafka_topic_partition_under_replicated_partition{topic=~\"$topico\"})"}
      ],
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "textMode": "value_and_name"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0}, "overrides": []}
    }
  ]
}
